    {
      "section": "dsh-waimao 🌐💬",
      "text": "**DeepSeek Harness (dsh) 外贸获客插件**：从「搜到链接」到「成交回款」的完整流程，全部装进你的 dsh。\n\n```\n设置ICP画像 → 三层搜索 → 提取联系方式 → 规则过滤 → AI评分(判断是否对口)\n   → 邮箱验证 → 开发信(dry-run,线程头,spintax,日上限)\n   → 人工审批 → 触达(邮件/WhatsApp) → IMAP回复扫描+AI分类 → 跟进序列\n   → CRM管线 → 官网监控(意图信号) → 报价PDF → 结案复盘 → 效果统计"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能总览（50 个对话工具 + 5 个网页）",
      "text": "| 模块 | 能力 |\n|---|---|\n| 🎯 **ICP 画像** | `icp_set` 一句话设置\"卖什么+找什么买家\"；评分判断线索是否对口（对口/沾边/不对口+理由），写开发信自动带上产品 |\n| 🌐 **谷歌获客** | 三层公式（基础搜索/LinkedIn职位定向/采购信号）、18个市场预设、逐层去重、引擎自动 failover、Google Maps 商家数据源(serpapi)、CSV导出 |\n| 🧪 **线索加工** | 抓页提取邮箱/WhatsApp/电话/社媒、**规则引擎过滤**（同行/B2B平台/黄页/招聘/社媒一眼排除）、**AI评分0-12分**（🔴极高/🟠高/🟡中/🟢低+开发建议）、自动入CRM去重合并 |\n| 📧 **邮箱发现验证** | 35+模式猜测 + MX记录 + SMTP RCPT探测 + catch-all检测（hunter.io 开源平替） |\n| ✉️ **开发信** | DeepSeek 个性化生成（带知识库引用）/ 三语模板兜底（英/西/**葡**）、零依赖SMTP客户端、**dry-run 总闸默认开**、**首触审批闸**、**回复线程头**、**退订脚注**、**Spintax 变体**、**三层日上限**（全局 / 每邮箱业务 / 每邮箱业务+预热总顶） |\n| 📬 **回复检测闭环** | **IMAP 扫描买家回复 → 正则先过滤(免费) → 模糊回复才调 AI**，12 类细分（感兴趣/约会议/询价/提问/拒绝/已离职/转介同事/休假/退订/退信）→ 自动改 replied + 停序列；退订进抑制列表、**退信整域名拉黑** |\n| 🛡️ **合规** | 抑制列表（地址+域名两级，发送强制拦截）、退订提示行（认 STOP/ALTO/PARAR）、全量审计日志 |\n| 📤 **标准导出** | CRM/搜索结果一键导出 Instantly/Smartlead 标准列（email/first_name/company/reason...），免映射导入；`reason` 字段带\"为什么选这条线索\" |\n| 📅 **跟进序列** | Day 0/3/7/14 四步自动跟进（挂原邮件线程）、回复即停、cron 定时执行 |\n| 📊 **CRM 管线** | 状态机（新→评估→触达→回复→报价→成交/流失）、客户档案、跟进活动、跨搜索去重合并、CSV导出 |\n| 🔐 **SOP 阶段机** | 八阶段服务端强制顺序（agent 不可跳步）、**人工审批门（哈希绑定，改动即失效）** |\n| 📚 **知识库** | 产品/报价政策/案例/市场规则，检索带 citation，AI 回复客户有据可依 |\n| 🕵️ **公司背调** | RDAP WHOIS（域名年龄，新站标警）+ 技术栈指纹（Shop"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\nnpx -y @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add github:shine-233/dsh-waimao"
    },
    {
      "section": "本地开发：add link:C:\\path\\to\\dsh-waimao",
      "text": "```\n\n重启 `dsh web`，浏览器打开：\n\n- `http://127.0.0.1:3080/waimao/leads` —— 谷歌获客（搜索→提取→评分→入CRM）\n- `http://127.0.0.1:3080/waimao/crm` —— CRM 管线（AI开发信/序列/状态流转）\n- `http://127.0.0.1:3080/waimao/review` —— WhatsApp 客服审核台\n- `http://127.0.0.1:3080/waimao/templates` —— 模板（邮件模板库 + 报价默认条款）\n- `http://127.0.0.1:3080/waimao/settings` —— 设置（全部配置+连通性测试+WhatsApp扫码）"
    },
    {
      "section": "快速上手（对话里说人话即可）",
      "text": "```\n我卖电吹风，找欧美批发商          → icp_set 存好画像（第一次用先做这个）\n\n帮我开发墨西哥电吹风买家\n→ sop_create → lead_search → lead_enrich → lead_score → email_compose"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "`~/.waimao/config.json`（推荐直接用设置页，带测试按钮）：\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"icp\": { \"product\": \"professional hair dryers 1800-2400W\", \"buyers\": \"wholesalers, beauty supply distributors\" },\n  \"serp\": {\n    \"engine\": \"ddg\", \"serpapiKey\": \"\", \"perLayer\": 10,"
    },
    {
      "section": "追踪与预热（需要公网入口）",
      "text": "dsh 只绑 127.0.0.1，收件人的邮件客户端打不到本机。要启用打开/点击追踪，给插件一个公网入口：\n\n```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：cloudflared 隧道（无需公网IP）",
      "text": "cloudflared tunnel --url http://127.0.0.1:3080"
    },
    {
      "section": "track.example.com → 127.0.0.1:3080",
      "text": "```\n\n然后 `config.track.publicBaseUrl` 填该域名。未配置时追踪静默关闭。安全设计：像素/点击端点用 24 位随机 ID（不可枚举），点击只 302 到发送时登记过的 URL（防开放重定向），响应零数据。\n\n邮箱预热（新域名/新账号必做，否则必进垃圾箱）：jsonc\n\"warmup\": {\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"maxPerDay\": 30,\n  \"partners\": [{ \"host\": \"smtp.partner.com\", \"user\": \"b@partner.com\", \"pass\": \"***\", \"imapHost\": \"imap.partner.com\" }]\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "track.example.com → 127.0.0.1:3080",
      "text": "cron 每天自动跑一轮预热池互动：池内邮箱按天轮换配对互发（主账号 + smtp.accounts 都参与，`warmup:false` 可退出），每邮箱独立爬坡第1周限5封/天、每周+5；收件侧自动回复+标星+已读，误入垃圾箱的预热邮件尽力挪回 INBOX。smtp.dry_run=true 时预热同样不真实发送。发信前先 `deliverability_check` 体检 SPF/DKIM/DMARC。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安全设计",
      "text": "- 所有网页/API 只接受回环+同源请求；webhook 必须带 token\n- API key/邮箱密码只存本机，浏览器永远拿不到\n- 邮件 dry-run 总闸默认开；**首触冷邮件需人工审批**（SOP 已批准草稿或网页手动发送，对齐 Instantly\"激活\"模式）；走 SOP 流程的发送强制使用批准稿（哈希绑定）\n- 群发默认 dry_run，真实发送有频控+熔断；全部动作进审计日志（`audit_query` 可查）"
    },
    {
      "section": "兼容性",
      "text": "基于 `@deepseek-ai/dsh 0.1.0-rc.7` 插件面（bundle patch / tools.register / webServer.register）。零 npm 依赖，Node ≥ 22.13。"
    },
    {
      "section": "免责声明",
      "text": "搜索请遵守引擎条款；邮件营销请遵守 CAN-SPAM/GDPR，提供退订方式；WhatsApp 自动化遵守其服务条款，控制频率防封号。Evolution API 为第三方开源网关。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-waimao",
      "text": "**Full-stack foreign-trade customer acquisition plugin for DeepSeek Harness (dsh).** Chinese docs: [README.md](./README.md)\n\n```\nICP profile → 3-layer Google search → contact extraction → rule filtering → AI scoring (ICP fit)\n  → email verify → cold email (dry-run, threading, spintax, daily cap) → human approval → outreach (email/WhatsApp)\n  → IMAP reply scan + AI classification → follow-up sequences → CRM pipeline\n  → website change monitoring → quotes → close & report"
    },
    {
      "section": "Highlights",
      "text": "- **ICP profile**: `icp_set` stores what you sell and who counts as your buyer. Scoring judges each lead's fit (yes/partial/no, with a reason — the OpenOutreach \"reason per lead\" idea), and email drafts know your product.\n- **Lead enrichment**: fetch pages, extract emails/WhatsApp/phones/socials, rule-engine excludes suppliers/B2B platforms/directories/job boards, AI scoring 0-12 with tiers and approach advice, auto-merge into CRM.\n- **Email finder & verifier**: 35+ pattern guesses + MX + SMTP RCPT probing + catch-all detection (open-source Hunter.io alternative).\n- **Cold email**: zero-dep SMTP client (implicit TLS / STARTTLS / AUTH), DeepSeek-personalized drafts with knowledge-base citations, trilingual templates (EN/ES/PT, auto-Spanish for LatAm), unsubscribe footer, **dry-run master switch**, **reply threading (In-Reply-To/References)**, **spintax variants** `{a|b|c}`, **per-day send cap** to protect new domains, optional **plain-text mode**.\n- **Reply loop (closed!)**: IMAP scan finds buyer replies, AI classifies them (interested / pricing / not-interested / OOO / auto / unsubscribe), auto-updates CRM to `replied`, stops sequences, auto-suppresses unsubscribes.\n- **CRM pipelin"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\nnpx -y @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add github:shine-233/dsh-waimao\n```\n\nOpen `http://127.0.0.1:3080/waimao/leads` after restarting `dsh web`. Configure at `/waimao/settings` (with connectivity test buttons for serp/smtp/imap/evolution/deepseek)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "`~/.waimao/config.json` (or the settings page):\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"icp\":    { \"product\": \"professional hair dryers 1800-2400W\", \"buyers\": \"wholesalers, beauty supply distributors\" },\n  \"serp\":   { \"engine\": \"ddg\", \"proxy\": \"http://127.0.0.1:7890\", \"chain\": [\"ddg\", \"serpapi\"] },\n  \"smtp\":   { \"host\": \"smtp.gmail.com\", \"port\": 465, \"user\": \"\", \"pass\": \"\", \"from\": \"\", \"dryRun\": true, \"dailyCap\": 300, \"plainText\": false },"
    },
    {
      "section": "Compliance notes",
      "text": "Cold email: honor unsubscribes (built-in footer + suppression list), respect CAN-SPAM/GDPR. WhatsApp automation follows unofficial APIs (Evolution API) — warm up numbers, keep volume low, ban risk is real. Search engines: respect their ToS."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
